# mdeai task naming — full titles always

**Canonical format (Linear + chat + docs):**

```text
SAN-### · SPEC-ID — <full Linear title>
```

Use the **middle dot** `·` after the SAN number — not em dash `—` alone.

**Markdown link (first mention in every chat reply):**

```markdown
[SAN-574 · D-08 — Shared browse system (VenueCard + BrowseLayout)](https://linear.app/sanjiovani/issue/SAN-574/d-08-shared-browse-system-venuecard-browselayout)
```

- **Slug URL** from Linear (`/issue/SAN-###/…`) — not bare `/issue/SAN-###`
- **SPEC-ID** = disk prefix (`D-08`, `EVT-033`, `PAY-001`, `UX-043`, `SCREEN-024`, …)
- **No SPEC-ID on Linear?** Use title segment — e.g. `SAN-728 · E2E — Camila schedule-viewing full flow`
- **Title** = exact Linear issue title (fetch via Linear MCP `get_issue` if unsure)
- **UX project** ([board](https://linear.app/sanjiovani/project/ux-0ad555e403b4/issues)): all 114 issues use this format (verified 2026-06-10)

## Chat — mandatory every reply

| ✅ Do | ❌ Don't |
|-------|----------|
| `[SAN-576 · D-10 — Re-skin Dashboard](url)` in tables | `SAN-576` or "D-10" alone |
| Bullet lists name **number + SPEC + title** | "the dashboard task" with no ID |
| Blockers: full linked name on first use | Bare `[SAN-576](url)` link text |
| Multi-task tables: column `Task (full name)` | Column header `SAN` only |

**Pair with:** [`mdeai-response-style.mdc`](./mdeai-response-style.mdc) §4 (persona + verdict shape).

## Where full names are also mandatory

| Surface | Rule |
|---------|------|
| Agent chat | Every table, verdict, blocker, next-step list |
| `docs/tasks/**/INDEX.md` | Every Linear row |
| `tasks/testing/evidence/**` | File H1 + `SAN-###-RESULTS.md` header |
| `mdeapp/todo.md` · changelogs | Every task row |
| PR body (human text) | SPEC-ID in title; `Closes SAN-###` footer OK |
| Linear issue titles | `SAN-### · SPEC-ID — …` (UX project enforced) |

## Allowed shorthand (narrow)

| OK | Not OK |
|----|--------|
| `Closes SAN-545` in PR footer | Chat: "545 is done" |
| Branch `ai/san-545-data-embed-fix` | Evidence H1: `# SAN-545` only |
| Filename `SAN-545-rental-embed-RESULTS.md` | `[SAN-545](url)` with no title in link text |

## Agent workflow

1. **Before** naming a task in chat: `get_issue` → copy Linear title verbatim
2. **Every** list of tasks uses full names — no exceptions in user-facing replies
3. **On edit** docs/todos: expand `SAN-###`-only to full name
4. **task-verifier / Done gate**: reject evidence whose H1 lacks `SAN-### · SPEC-ID — title`

